      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Secret Manager**\n\nI'm starting to build a plan for the Python script. It'll be called `fetch_api_key.py`. My primary task is to retrieve the API key from a secure secrets store. I've decided to use Google Secret Manager for this task, so I need to begin building the code around that specific provider.\n\n\n**Outlining Key Functions**\n\nI've sketched out the initial structure for `fetch_api_key.py`. My primary function will be to retrieve the secret using Google Secret Manager. I'm focusing on incorporating the `google.cloud.secretmanager` import and client to ensure the provider is easily identified within the code. Currently, my plan includes three main steps: file creation, secret retrieval implementation, and provider identification within the code.\n\n\n",
